. * ---- Part 3: joint model or meta-analysis? ---------------------------------
. * the same classes fitted one at a time, then combined
. forvalues s = 1/4 {
  2.     quietly nwsaom, waves(school`s'_w1 school`s'_w2) outdegree reciprocity transtrip seed(5)
  3.     estimates store school`s'
  4. }

